OL,3,GNEWSAMan and woman found dead at house
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo people have been found dead at a
OL,6,Fhouse in Cheshire.
OL,8,FThe bodies of a 78-year-old man and a
OL,9,F79-year-old woman were found at a
OL,10,Fproperty on Grange Park Avenue in
OL,11,FWilmslow on Saturday, Cheshire Police
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FPolice attended the address following
OL,15,Fconcerns for the welfare of the
OL,16,Foccupants.
OL,18,FDetectives said inquiries to establish
OL,19,Fthe full circumstances of the incident
OL,20,Fwere "ongoing" but added they did not
OL,21,Fbelieve there was any third-party
OL,22,Finvolvement.
